'''Inky Doge''' (インキーわんこ, ''Inkī Wanko'', '''Inky Doggy''') is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy that appears in the [[PAC-MAN Collaboration Event]]. It was added in [[Version 15.5 Update|Version 15.5]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Inky Doge
|image = E 779.png
|first appearance = [[PAC-MAN Collaboration Event]]
|money drop = 30¢ - 118¢
}}

==Enemy==
A [[Doge]] with doubled stats and significantly increased speed. Despite the scary costume, this enemy is still just a peon.

==Strategy==
Just like the original Doge, this enemy does not pose a serious threat. Almost anything is capable of killing it.

